1
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,979
Look with your heart and see clearly

2
00:00:32,979 --> 00:00:35,960
The truth is not far away

3
00:00:35,960 --> 00:00:38,980
Hey you good or bad, truth or lies

4
00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:41,980
Can't escape this soul's gray haze

5
00:00:41,980 --> 00:00:44,960
Take all your bravery

6
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:48,140
Maybe you can save the world

7
00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:50,299
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

8
00:00:50,299 --> 00:00:53,719
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

9
00:00:53,719 --> 00:00:56,679
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

10
00:00:56,679 --> 00:00:57,900
Mojo Spy

11
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:13,319
Storm is coming

12
00:01:24,480 --> 00:01:26,640
Tantalus's ordeal is truly pitiful

13
00:01:26,640 --> 00:01:29,519
But what does this have to do with

14
00:01:29,519 --> 00:01:33,319
the mutated golden monkey?

15
00:01:39,299 --> 00:01:42,079
The light it gives off is so beautiful, so beautiful

16
00:01:42,079 --> 00:01:43,259
Yeah, yeah

17
00:01:43,259 --> 00:01:44,899
Feeling wrapped in this glow

18
00:01:44,899 --> 00:01:47,060
My mood is brighter too

19
00:01:47,060 --> 00:01:49,920
This is a twin necklace passed down in my family

20
00:01:49,920 --> 00:01:51,840
Its name is the Pendant of Tantalus

21
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:56,159
The harmonious light it emits

22
00:01:56,159 --> 00:02:00,659
Can soothe the heart and bring peace

23
00:02:09,699 --> 00:02:10,840
The twin necklace is made of a strange metal

24
00:02:10,840 --> 00:02:15,180
Its properties are exactly the opposite of the mutated golden monkey's

25
00:02:15,180 --> 00:02:16,979
Yes

26
00:02:16,979 --> 00:02:20,539
I've studied the properties of both of them as well.

27
00:02:20,740 --> 00:02:22,560
Just as you said,

28
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:25,539
their properties are exact opposites.

29
00:02:25,539 --> 00:02:30,359
Then I tried using the necklace to help the golden monkey recover.

30
00:02:30,359 --> 00:02:33,000
But the results still came up empty.

31
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:37,560
Doctor, you said these are twin necklaces.

32
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:40,739
So where is the other one?

33
00:02:40,739 --> 00:02:43,979
The other Tantalus Pendant

34
00:02:43,979 --> 00:02:48,060
is worn by my twin brother, Storm.

35
00:02:48,060 --> 00:02:51,299
Wow, there's another necklace?

36
00:02:51,299 --> 00:02:54,079
Is the other one just as beautiful?

37
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:56,840
Yeah, my brother Storm's necklace

38
00:02:56,840 --> 00:02:59,260
looks basically the same as mine.

39
00:02:59,260 --> 00:03:02,080
But his necklace radiates

40
00:03:02,080 --> 00:03:03,340
a power like a black hole

41
00:03:03,340 --> 00:03:05,900
that devours all light.

42
00:03:05,900 --> 00:03:08,040
Maybe it's because of

43
00:03:08,040 --> 00:03:10,460
the necklace he wears.

44
00:03:10,460 --> 00:03:12,740
Storm was a troublemaker since childhood.

45
00:03:12,740 --> 00:03:14,560
He gave everyone headaches.

46
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:16,840
I haven't seen him for many years.

47
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:18,680
And now I have no idea

48
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:20,560
where my good-for-nothing brother

49
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:22,280
actually is.

50
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:25,479
Both necklaces share the name Tantalus Pendant.

51
00:03:25,479 --> 00:03:28,719
Perhaps they respectively represent the gods' favor toward Tantalus

52
00:03:28,719 --> 00:03:30,280
and his own greed and arrogance.

53
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:33,060
In other words, the two necklaces are opposites of each other.

54
00:03:33,060 --> 00:03:36,620
The attributes of Dr. Breeze's necklace are opposite to those of the mutated golden monkeys.

55
00:03:36,620 --> 00:03:38,780
So the strange power of the mutated golden monkeys

56
00:03:38,780 --> 00:03:40,719
must be connected to the other necklace.

57
00:03:40,719 --> 00:03:43,960
So the only way to save the golden monkeys is to find my brother.

58
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:45,920
The little detective's reasoning sounds very convincing.

59
00:03:45,920 --> 00:03:48,280
Looks like the golden monkeys are saved.

60
00:03:48,280 --> 00:03:50,460
Locky really is becoming more and more like a detective.

61
00:03:50,460 --> 00:03:56,020
I think we should go report to Captain Han right away.

62
00:03:56,020 --> 00:03:57,920
We'll do our best, in the shortest possible time,

63
00:03:57,920 --> 00:04:00,520
to find Dr. Breeze's brother.

64
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:03,060
Goodbye.

65
00:04:03,060 --> 00:04:03,640
Goodbye.

66
00:04:08,599 --> 00:04:09,580
Now they're saved.

67
00:04:20,459 --> 00:04:23,799
According to reliable information,

68
00:04:23,799 --> 00:04:25,839
this golden monkey mutation incident

69
00:04:25,839 --> 00:04:27,680
is connected to the Illumin-Eye.

70
00:04:27,680 --> 00:04:29,819
Ever since we stopped

71
00:04:29,819 --> 00:04:30,839
the Illumin-Eye's plan last time,

72
00:04:30,839 --> 00:04:32,419
their criminal methods

73
00:04:32,419 --> 00:04:34,279
have become even more brutal and cunning.

74
00:04:34,279 --> 00:04:36,979
So this situation is extremely dangerous.

75
00:04:36,979 --> 00:04:39,079
Everyone must not act rashly.

76
00:04:39,079 --> 00:04:40,679
Everyone here

77
00:04:40,679 --> 00:04:42,519
got that?

78
00:04:45,500 --> 00:04:47,740
Doctor, something—something's happened!

79
00:04:47,740 --> 00:04:56,180
Hawxing, don't act alone.

80
00:04:56,180 --> 00:05:00,040
Inspector Sima

81
00:05:00,040 --> 00:05:01,819
take Xiao Li to the infirmary.

82
00:05:01,819 --> 00:05:02,759
Let's go out and see

83
00:05:02,759 --> 00:05:03,620
what's going on.

84
00:05:03,620 --> 00:05:03,840
Okay.

85
00:05:22,699 --> 00:05:23,100
Where are you going?

86
00:05:23,100 --> 00:05:24,560
To catch the culprit.

87
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:27,300
I won't allow you to act on your own.

88
00:05:27,300 --> 00:05:29,079
I don't have to follow your orders.

89
00:05:29,079 --> 00:05:32,079
This is an emergency.

90
00:05:32,079 --> 00:05:34,060
Rushing out recklessly

91
00:05:34,060 --> 00:05:36,180
could easily fall into The Illumin-Eye's trap.

92
00:05:36,180 --> 00:05:37,480
As a police officer,

93
00:05:37,480 --> 00:05:39,079
I have a duty to protect everyone's safety.

94
00:05:39,079 --> 00:05:41,439
So until we know friend from foe,

95
00:05:41,439 --> 00:05:43,259
no one makes a move.

96
00:05:43,259 --> 00:05:47,379
Doctor, are you alright?

97
00:05:47,379 --> 00:05:51,319
I never thought it would be Storm.

98
00:05:51,319 --> 00:05:52,980
Storm?

99
00:05:52,980 --> 00:05:56,639
I was just organizing the data

100
00:05:56,639 --> 00:05:59,899
when Storm suddenly burst in.

101
00:05:59,899 --> 00:06:02,939
Guard Xiao Li rushed forward to stop him,

102
00:06:02,939 --> 00:06:04,920
But he was no match for him.

103
00:06:04,920 --> 00:06:07,120
I hurried forward.

104
00:06:07,120 --> 00:06:10,639
Unexpectedly, he tossed Xiao Li aside.

105
00:06:10,639 --> 00:06:11,819
Then he pulled out a hunting rifle.

106
00:06:11,819 --> 00:06:14,379
Forcing me to hand over the golden monkey and the golden twin necklaces.

107
00:06:14,379 --> 00:06:16,839
I charged at him to snatch the rifle from his hands.

108
00:06:16,840 --> 00:06:19,600
In a moment of carelessness, he knocked me out.

109
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:22,220
Hawxing.

110
00:06:22,220 --> 00:06:24,460
Now the suspect already has both necklaces.

111
00:06:24,460 --> 00:06:26,440
The Illumin-Eye is watching greedily from the side.

112
00:06:26,440 --> 00:06:29,600
I absolutely can't let you go alone.

113
00:06:29,600 --> 00:06:34,800
Are you just going to watch them escape?

114
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:35,300
You—

115
00:06:35,300 --> 00:06:36,900
Fine.

116
00:06:36,900 --> 00:06:39,420
I allow you to pursue the suspect.

117
00:06:39,420 --> 00:06:42,080
But you must be accompanied by Inspector Sima and Detective Chen.

118
00:06:42,320 --> 00:06:44,880
And you must promise to follow their arrangements.

119
00:06:44,880 --> 00:06:46,500
As long as they don't slow me down,

120
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:47,819
I can take them with me.

121
00:06:47,819 --> 00:06:51,339
I will never follow anyone's orders.

122
00:06:58,300 --> 00:06:59,220
His personality is awful.

123
00:06:59,220 --> 00:07:02,040
He's just eager to solve the case. Forgive him.

124
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:05,019
Alright. I hope you can bring him back safely.

125
00:07:05,019 --> 00:07:06,800
This incident is truly no small matter.

126
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:08,399
You all be careful too.

127
00:07:08,399 --> 00:07:10,180
Captain, don't worry.

128
00:07:10,180 --> 00:07:11,300
Detective Chen, let's go.

129
00:07:11,300 --> 00:07:15,680
Wait, please take me with you.

130
00:07:15,680 --> 00:07:17,280
I want to talk to Storm.

131
00:07:17,280 --> 00:07:18,699
To change his mind.

132
00:07:21,699 --> 00:07:22,180
Thank you.

133
00:07:22,180 --> 00:07:35,680
Locky.

134
00:07:35,680 --> 00:07:37,280
This situation is too dangerous.

135
00:07:37,280 --> 00:07:38,199
Having one Hawxing

136
00:07:38,199 --> 00:07:39,399
is already a big headache.

137
00:07:39,399 --> 00:07:41,199
So you'd better

138
00:07:41,199 --> 00:07:42,220
just stay put

139
00:07:42,220 --> 00:07:42,899
and wait here.

140
00:07:42,899 --> 00:07:45,460
I say, Officer Han,

141
00:07:45,460 --> 00:07:50,740
haven't you noticed that Dr. Breeze has been acting weird since he got injured?

142
00:07:50,740 --> 00:07:53,700
Oh? Weird how?

143
00:07:53,700 --> 00:07:57,520
Dr. Breeze is a sloppy scientist who never bothers with details.

144
00:07:57,520 --> 00:08:00,080
But I noticed that after he was injured,

145
00:08:00,080 --> 00:08:03,840
he actually straightened his tie neatly.

146
00:08:03,840 --> 00:08:06,920
His hair is much tidier too.

147
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:11,840
Also, Dr. Breeze was originally extremely nearsighted.

148
00:08:11,840 --> 00:08:14,160
But when Jingjing handed him his glasses,

149
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:17,520
he folded them and put them in his pocket.

150
00:08:17,520 --> 00:08:19,360
And...

151
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:22,560
These two giant culture dishes are a bit different from before.

152
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:23,920
Different how?

153
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:26,180
Remember Dr. Breeze said before—

154
00:08:26,180 --> 00:08:28,380
The two culture dishes are to prevent the nutrient solution from overfilling.

155
00:08:28,380 --> 00:08:30,940
That's why they're connected—in case the solution overflows.

156
00:08:30,940 --> 00:08:37,139
But now the golden monkey is no longer in the culture dish,

157
00:08:38,920 --> 00:08:41,940
yet the water level in the other culture dish has risen.

158
00:08:41,940 --> 00:08:46,760
I suspect something suspicious has gotten into the nutrient solution.

159
00:08:46,760 --> 00:08:50,180
That does sound strange.

160
00:08:50,180 --> 00:08:54,020
But how can we find out what's actually in the culture dish?

161
00:08:54,020 --> 00:08:56,340
Simple. Open it.

162
00:08:56,340 --> 00:08:59,240
Dr. said the nutrient solution is very precious.

163
00:08:59,240 --> 00:09:00,880
If it spills carelessly, the cost is enormous.

164
00:09:00,880 --> 00:09:02,580
We should at least wait until it comes back before opening it.

165
00:09:02,580 --> 00:09:04,000
This is an emergency. We can't worry about that.

166
00:09:15,799 --> 00:09:15,880
Ah, another Dr. Breeze.

167
00:09:15,880 --> 00:09:18,420
Strange.

168
00:09:18,420 --> 00:09:21,980
Didn't Dr. Breeze just leave with Uncle?

169
00:09:21,980 --> 00:09:24,900
I'm afraid this one is the real Dr. Breeze.

170
00:09:24,900 --> 00:09:27,240
And the one who left with Uncle earlier—

171
00:09:27,240 --> 00:09:28,560
must be Storm.

172
00:09:28,560 --> 00:09:29,240
Uh-oh.

173
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:30,520
Uncle and the others are in danger.

174
00:09:30,520 --> 00:09:32,360
We have to contact them immediately.

175
00:09:32,360 --> 00:09:34,360
Inspector Sima.

176
00:09:34,360 --> 00:09:36,140
I'm Jiawei Han.

177
00:09:36,140 --> 00:09:37,200
Do you read me?

178
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:40,560
Not good.

179
00:09:40,560 --> 00:09:42,320
They must have left the communication range.